WEBVTT

00:17.642 --> 00:18.852
Are the rumors true?

00:19.519 --> 00:20.520
What rumors?

00:21.021 --> 00:23.815
That you, Su-ho, and Si-eun
caught some thugs.

00:23.898 --> 00:25.066
The Free Money guys.

00:27.610 --> 00:28.903
Oh, yeah.

00:29.487 --> 00:31.156
Whoa, that's lit.

00:31.239 --> 00:33.491
My friend lost a lot on that site.

00:33.575 --> 00:35.493
What happened? Tell us everything.

00:35.577 --> 00:36.453
Hurry. Tell us!

00:36.536 --> 00:38.496
- Add me on Instagram!
- I'm dying to know!

00:49.716 --> 00:51.384
Did you get home safely that day?

00:52.635 --> 00:54.137
Oh, yeah.

00:55.346 --> 00:56.181
You?

00:56.848 --> 00:58.058
I got home safely too.

01:03.563 --> 01:04.731
So freaking cool.

01:16.993 --> 01:17.827
Let's sit here.

01:34.719 --> 01:36.304
You can eat all that?

01:36.387 --> 01:37.597
I'm gonna get some snacks too.

01:37.680 --> 01:39.599
- Right, Oh Beom?
- Yeah.

01:39.682 --> 01:41.768
- I'll pay, so let's all go.
- You always pay.

01:41.851 --> 01:43.853
Everything is on me today!

01:43.937 --> 01:45.772
Whatever you want, it's yours.

01:47.148 --> 01:48.775
Are you free this weekend?

01:49.275 --> 01:51.319
I found a good place to eat. Let's try it.

01:51.402 --> 01:52.946
I'm down for good restaurants.

01:53.029 --> 01:55.031
Let's go.

01:57.367 --> 01:59.494
You're talking about food while eating?

02:02.831 --> 02:06.126
Well, don't you talk about life
while living?

02:12.841 --> 02:14.175
Did Yeong-i find a job?

02:14.717 --> 02:16.010
She has an interview.

02:17.178 --> 02:19.055
They need someone, so it works out.

02:20.390 --> 02:21.432
Who's Yeong-i?

02:21.516 --> 02:23.017
You know, the girl.

02:23.643 --> 02:25.436
The one who smashed that thug's head.

02:27.147 --> 02:27.981
Oh.

02:28.606 --> 02:30.108
Did you know her from before?

02:30.191 --> 02:31.025
No.

02:35.155 --> 02:36.698
She's staying at Su-ho's.

02:36.781 --> 02:38.491
Should we invite her this weekend?

02:42.245 --> 02:44.205
That's fine. I don't mind.

03:19.782 --> 03:23.161
AHN SU-HO

03:23.828 --> 03:28.958
AHN SU-HO
FOLLOWING

03:36.257 --> 03:38.635
YEONG-I

03:42.013 --> 03:48.895
CHILLING AT HAN RIVER

03:54.776 --> 03:56.486
DINNER WITH SU-HO'S GRANDMA

04:01.741 --> 04:04.285
SI-EUN SURPRISED US WITH TASTY HAMBURGERS!

04:29.852 --> 04:30.728
How's your dad?

04:33.523 --> 04:36.567
He's busy these days
'cause it's the season.

04:40.405 --> 04:41.656
What are your next steps?

04:45.618 --> 04:46.494
I'm not sure.

04:47.161 --> 04:49.289
It's okay. Take your time to decide.

04:50.123 --> 04:51.916
I'm not worried about you.

04:52.583 --> 04:54.168
You're good at everything.

04:57.714 --> 04:59.215
I'm bad at many things.

05:08.266 --> 05:09.309
Never mind.

05:16.232 --> 05:17.442
Are you done eating?

05:17.525 --> 05:19.902
Let's have coffee to go. I have a meeting.

05:24.490 --> 05:25.325
Yes?

05:26.367 --> 05:27.201
I'm going now.

05:28.494 --> 05:30.204
What should we do for your birthday?

05:30.705 --> 05:31.622
What should we do?

05:32.206 --> 05:33.708
What are you talking about?

05:33.791 --> 05:35.251
Let's just have a nice meal.

05:36.961 --> 05:38.713
We've got to do something.

05:38.796 --> 05:40.131
Something fucking fun!

05:40.923 --> 05:42.633
There's no need, busybody.

05:43.217 --> 05:44.260
Is it your birthday?

05:45.178 --> 05:46.596
Saturday two weeks from now.

05:47.347 --> 05:48.806
Maybe we can rent a party room.

05:48.890 --> 05:49.724
Yeong-i.

05:50.641 --> 05:54.187
Aren't you saving money?
Weren't you looking for a room to rent?

06:00.151 --> 06:02.153
The menu's big! What should I get?

06:04.113 --> 06:05.323
What are you gonna have?

06:06.532 --> 06:08.034
Iced Americano for me.

06:08.117 --> 06:10.578
I'll have an iced Vienna coffee.

06:13.289 --> 06:14.540
Let's grab a table.

06:15.958 --> 06:17.001
This spot is good.

06:20.129 --> 06:21.089
Sit here.

06:22.965 --> 06:24.342
Would you like to order?

06:43.986 --> 06:44.904
Hey, Si-eun!

06:47.824 --> 06:49.325
Hurry up and sit down!

06:50.118 --> 06:52.036
What's this? Why are you dressed up?

06:53.037 --> 06:56.541
- Did you think I'd like it? Clever boy.
- Where were you?

06:59.419 --> 07:00.628
An appointment.

07:01.337 --> 07:02.839
What kind of appointment?

07:03.423 --> 07:05.925
He's so fucking secretive.

07:06.008 --> 07:07.969
I know where he's been.

07:09.804 --> 07:11.389
Stop tracking me.

07:11.472 --> 07:13.558
No! I'll track you all the way home.

07:13.641 --> 07:14.892
Yeah, track him.

07:15.435 --> 07:16.477
You know WithMap?

07:18.896 --> 07:20.231
Oh Beom, what's up?

07:43.796 --> 07:48.926
WEAK HERO:
CLASS 1

09:13.302 --> 09:14.220
Do you want a drink?

09:15.346 --> 09:16.222
Do you want a drink?

09:16.722 --> 09:18.015
I can come with you.

09:18.099 --> 09:19.350
It's okay. I'll go.

09:49.130 --> 09:50.214
Shit.

09:50.840 --> 09:52.300
What? It's Oh Beom-seok!

09:53.050 --> 09:53.884
Beom-seok! Hey!

09:54.635 --> 09:56.178
Why is Beom-seok here?

09:56.262 --> 09:58.556
- Really!
- That's ridiculous. Don't lie.

09:58.639 --> 10:00.349
- I really saw him.
- Beom-seok!

10:00.433 --> 10:03.394
- Is he ignoring us?
- Where are you, Beom-seok?

10:03.477 --> 10:04.437
Can Beom-seok sing?

10:05.021 --> 10:06.897
- Beom-seok!
- Hey, call him.

10:30.838 --> 10:32.340
Yeah, we're at karaoke.

10:33.591 --> 10:34.759
What's the room number?

10:35.259 --> 10:36.093
I don't know.

10:38.179 --> 10:40.097
Your friends keep calling!

10:43.434 --> 10:45.102
What are you doing, crazy bitch?

10:45.186 --> 10:47.521
Why the fuck did you answer my phone?

10:49.649 --> 10:51.108
Hey, what's going on?

10:52.026 --> 10:53.402
What? You gonna hit me?

10:54.779 --> 10:55.821
Fuck. Seriously?

10:56.322 --> 10:57.990
Hey, that's enough.

10:58.074 --> 10:59.283
What's this all about?

11:01.827 --> 11:02.912
Beom-seok.

11:05.289 --> 11:06.874
I said that's enough.

11:13.464 --> 11:15.716
Have you gone fucking nuts, asshole?

11:16.926 --> 11:17.760
Move.

11:18.344 --> 11:19.679
Hey!

11:21.847 --> 11:22.932
I'll go after her.

11:26.060 --> 11:27.269
Where are you going?

11:31.982 --> 11:32.817
Are you okay?

11:37.697 --> 11:38.531
Yeah.

11:39.365 --> 11:40.241
I'm okay.

11:41.992 --> 11:43.119
Hey, Beom-seok!

11:43.202 --> 11:44.453
I told you I saw him!

11:44.537 --> 11:46.205
Our little Beom-seok!

11:47.915 --> 11:48.916
How are things?

11:50.543 --> 11:52.336
It's been ages.

11:52.920 --> 11:54.255
We missed you.

11:55.047 --> 11:55.923
Seriously!

11:57.591 --> 11:58.426
What's this?

11:59.635 --> 12:00.886
We're his friends.

12:04.223 --> 12:05.307
We were talking.

12:06.684 --> 12:09.061
We wanted a word, as it's been so long.

12:11.230 --> 12:12.481
Then come back later.

12:18.821 --> 12:19.780
My bad.

12:20.865 --> 12:21.782
See you soon.

12:21.866 --> 12:22.908
We'll call you.

12:24.034 --> 12:25.619
Make sure you answer.

12:27.538 --> 12:28.497
Let's go.

12:28.581 --> 12:29.498
See you!

12:30.541 --> 12:31.834
Still a loser.

12:35.963 --> 12:36.797
What was that?

12:39.800 --> 12:40.634
Those kids.

12:43.179 --> 12:44.054
Oh.

12:45.848 --> 12:46.891
It's nothing.

12:52.813 --> 12:53.689
Come on.

12:55.024 --> 12:56.442
Man, seriously.

12:59.487 --> 13:02.323
- He's so good with the tongue.
- He sounds like a dumbass.

13:03.199 --> 13:05.785
- You can do this all day.
- Do that every single day.

13:06.619 --> 13:07.453
Hey.

13:12.458 --> 13:13.542
Hey!

13:18.297 --> 13:19.340
Be quiet.

13:24.428 --> 13:25.846
I said shut the hell up.

13:34.188 --> 13:35.356
Did you laugh at me?

13:36.440 --> 13:37.399
No, I didn't.

13:38.484 --> 13:40.528
You laughed at me, didn't you?

13:40.611 --> 13:42.446
Do you want to die, cocksucker?

13:44.198 --> 13:45.032
Beom-seok.

13:46.116 --> 13:46.951
What's going on?

13:49.954 --> 13:52.414
This bastard's acting cocky
because of his friends.

13:52.498 --> 13:53.332
What?

13:55.084 --> 13:56.460
Hey, move.

13:56.544 --> 13:58.838
What's this? What's going on?

13:58.921 --> 14:00.631
I don't know. He just flipped out.

14:00.714 --> 14:02.383
- Fucking asshole!
- Enough.

14:02.466 --> 14:04.009
Hey, that's enough.

14:04.093 --> 14:05.761
What are you looking at, fucker?

14:05.845 --> 14:08.013
Why are you acting so tough? It's cute.

14:08.097 --> 14:09.849
Si-eun, let's get some snacks.

14:12.560 --> 14:14.436
Stop putting your arm around me.

14:16.647 --> 14:17.481
What?

14:27.575 --> 14:28.951
What's wrong with him?

14:50.848 --> 14:55.686
FUCKER 3

14:55.769 --> 14:56.687
15 MISSED CALLS

14:56.770 --> 14:58.105
16 MISSED CALLS

14:58.188 --> 15:01.775
FUCKER 4

15:12.828 --> 15:15.664
17 MISSED CALLS

15:51.116 --> 15:52.201
How was it?

15:52.284 --> 15:54.536
Isn't it great to work up a sweat
in the morning?

15:58.040 --> 15:59.959
Were you able to speak to Oh Beom?

16:03.337 --> 16:04.338
No.

16:04.421 --> 16:06.882
What's going on there?

16:06.966 --> 16:07.967
He won't answer.

16:08.717 --> 16:09.551
Later on,

16:10.594 --> 16:12.012
we could stop by his place.

16:12.805 --> 16:14.431
Let's do that.

16:16.225 --> 16:18.310
Okay, stand up!

16:19.144 --> 16:21.814
You said we were only running.
There's more?

16:21.897 --> 16:23.273
I said I'd train you.

16:24.149 --> 16:25.150
Just the basics.

16:28.821 --> 16:30.781
Feet shoulder width apart.

16:31.490 --> 16:33.367
Feet turned out diagonally.

16:34.243 --> 16:35.452
I don't need this.

16:35.536 --> 16:37.079
You must be tired. Go rest.

16:37.579 --> 16:39.665
Don't worry. I'm not tired. Go ahead.

16:44.003 --> 16:46.046
Always keep your chin tucked.

16:47.589 --> 16:48.590
Arms like this.

16:49.591 --> 16:52.052
Your arms must always protect your chin.

16:52.136 --> 16:54.221
Remember. Your chin.

16:55.139 --> 16:55.973
There we go.

16:56.640 --> 16:58.934
Let's say you're facing some punk.

16:59.018 --> 17:01.770
They're trying
to beat the hell out of you.

17:02.312 --> 17:04.898
If that happens,
don't look them in the eyes.

17:04.982 --> 17:06.233
Watch the shoulders.

17:08.027 --> 17:08.861
Now watch.

17:11.947 --> 17:13.407
Watch this shoulder.

17:14.074 --> 17:16.577
When the shoulder is coming at you,

17:16.660 --> 17:18.454
bend at a 90-degree angle.

17:19.872 --> 17:22.291
Now grab their knees and push them down.

17:22.374 --> 17:24.168
One, two, three. Bam.

17:26.128 --> 17:27.504
This is a takedown.

17:28.756 --> 17:31.091
And then you just… you fucking just…

17:33.343 --> 17:35.137
Don't hit them. Run.

17:36.180 --> 17:37.389
Don't look back.

17:39.975 --> 17:41.727
Get out while they're down.

17:43.228 --> 17:44.772
Don't fight and get hurt.

17:48.776 --> 17:49.610
You got it?

17:58.994 --> 17:59.828
Here, right?

18:00.329 --> 18:01.872
Fucking fancy place.

18:07.503 --> 18:08.796
What are you doing here?

18:12.174 --> 18:13.926
Why is your phone always off?

18:15.928 --> 18:17.888
I didn't realize. Come in.

18:19.348 --> 18:21.892
Why did you skip school?

18:24.228 --> 18:25.562
Fucking fancy place.

18:26.146 --> 18:27.815
I'm not feeling well.

18:28.315 --> 18:30.109
- Wear those.
- Wow.

18:30.192 --> 18:32.361
You're skinny because you live here.

18:32.444 --> 18:34.321
You get a workout from going room to room.

18:35.531 --> 18:36.657
Why is it so big?

18:38.075 --> 18:40.077
Is this a money tree or something?

18:40.160 --> 18:43.664
The tree that's meant to make people rich?

18:44.414 --> 18:45.457
This is crazy.

18:46.458 --> 18:48.669
My whole place could fit in this room.

18:49.169 --> 18:50.295
Are you very sick?

18:52.172 --> 18:53.006
Oh?

18:53.090 --> 18:55.092
No, just a little.

18:55.175 --> 18:57.928
Hey, your mother is really pretty.

18:58.011 --> 18:59.680
Your family looks so happy.

19:00.597 --> 19:02.349
Everyone looks alike.

19:03.142 --> 19:04.351
That's not my family.

19:08.397 --> 19:11.483
My father openly adopted me
when he entered politics.

19:11.567 --> 19:13.277
For his public image.

19:19.867 --> 19:21.034
Would you like a drink?

19:30.419 --> 19:31.545
Is something wrong?

19:33.630 --> 19:35.632
- No, nothing.
- Hey.

19:35.716 --> 19:37.342
What is it?

19:37.885 --> 19:39.386
Tell me what's up.

19:42.097 --> 19:42.931
Is it because of…

19:44.766 --> 19:47.394
the kids we saw the other day…

19:49.438 --> 19:50.522
at karaoke?

19:50.606 --> 19:51.440
Karaoke?

19:52.024 --> 19:53.025
What do you mean?

20:07.831 --> 20:09.917
Hey, move it.

20:10.918 --> 20:11.919
Stand at ease.

20:13.170 --> 20:15.380
I said at ease, you fucking mongrel.

20:15.464 --> 20:16.423
Hurry up!

20:17.424 --> 20:19.384
- Did you forget how?
- I said stand up!

20:19.468 --> 20:21.220
- Here it comes
- Go at full power.

20:21.303 --> 20:22.888
Show him!

20:22.971 --> 20:23.889
Nice!

20:26.558 --> 20:28.518
- Are you crying?
- Fucking pleb.

20:28.602 --> 20:29.937
Fuck, you're not hurt.

20:30.020 --> 20:30.854
Beom-seok.

20:31.438 --> 20:33.190
Go snitch to Daddy again.

20:33.774 --> 20:34.775
Hey, let's go.

20:34.858 --> 20:36.568
Fuck, hitting him is no fun.

20:36.652 --> 20:38.779
Hey, I'm hungry. Let's go eat.

20:43.533 --> 20:45.494
At my previous school,

20:46.912 --> 20:48.330
I was bullied.

20:49.706 --> 20:50.999
Because of them,

20:52.668 --> 20:54.002
I was hospitalized,

20:55.128 --> 20:56.838
and I had to change schools.

20:58.924 --> 21:01.343
Since seeing them at karaoke,

21:01.843 --> 21:03.053
they keep calling me,

21:03.971 --> 21:05.097
asking me to come out.

21:07.432 --> 21:08.475
Oh fuck.

21:09.518 --> 21:11.687
Why did those fuckers pick you?

21:13.855 --> 21:15.148
What was it?

21:15.732 --> 21:17.818
That's just the way it is.

21:17.901 --> 21:20.195
They form a bond by picking on other kids.

21:20.946 --> 21:22.322
It raises their own status.

21:22.948 --> 21:25.742
I did nothing wrong. I was just there.

21:27.744 --> 21:28.996
It's okay, Beom-seok.

21:32.624 --> 21:33.834
It's not your fault.

21:41.383 --> 21:42.592
Call those fucks.

21:46.972 --> 21:47.806
What?

21:50.475 --> 21:51.935
I'll get you an apology.

21:53.520 --> 21:54.354
Call them.

22:01.570 --> 22:03.947
Hey, that's awful. It's just shit.

22:07.743 --> 22:08.952
DOG BEOM-SEOK

22:09.036 --> 22:10.245
Hey!

22:11.121 --> 22:12.706
Why did you stop it?

22:13.206 --> 22:15.125
Fucking Beom-seok is calling!

22:15.208 --> 22:16.043
Really?

22:16.960 --> 22:18.503
- Shut up a minute.
- Really?

22:21.381 --> 22:23.216
Beom-seok, where are you?

22:29.681 --> 22:32.434
These guys are always singing.
Don't they study?

22:33.143 --> 22:34.561
Look who's talking.

22:40.859 --> 22:42.736
Don't sweat it. I'm with you.

23:15.560 --> 23:16.812
Beom-sucks!

23:17.479 --> 23:19.231
- Hey, Oh Beom.
- Beom-seok!

23:19.314 --> 23:20.816
Did you bring friends?

23:22.275 --> 23:23.735
Fuck, it reeks of cigarettes.

23:26.530 --> 23:27.781
What's this?

23:31.451 --> 23:32.285
Apologize.

23:36.915 --> 23:38.125
I said apologize.

23:41.378 --> 23:42.212
Fucking crazy.

23:42.295 --> 23:43.171
Look at him!

23:46.133 --> 23:47.801
Apologize for what?

23:47.884 --> 23:49.553
For what you did to me.

23:50.262 --> 23:51.930
Hey, Beom-seok.

23:53.056 --> 23:54.182
You apologize

23:55.183 --> 23:57.144
only when you do something wrong.

23:58.478 --> 23:59.896
We're friends.

24:00.564 --> 24:01.398
Right?

24:03.066 --> 24:04.860
We were just playing around.

24:06.736 --> 24:07.654
So what's this?

24:12.742 --> 24:13.577
Hey.

24:15.036 --> 24:17.122
- Apologize properly.
- What?

24:17.205 --> 24:18.915
How many times do we need to say it?

24:19.416 --> 24:21.126
Apologize, or you'll die.

24:21.209 --> 24:22.627
Yeah? Don't mess around.

24:26.214 --> 24:27.716
Beom-seok.

24:31.344 --> 24:33.847
What are you trying to do, fucker?

24:37.767 --> 24:39.478
Do you wanna be friends like before?

24:40.937 --> 24:42.105
Meet up every day?

24:47.319 --> 24:48.862
Are you ignoring me right now?

24:50.447 --> 24:52.240
- Wait!
- Apologize properly.

24:52.324 --> 24:53.909
- Okay, I got it!
- Say it.

24:53.992 --> 24:56.119
I got it. I said I got it, fuck.

25:04.211 --> 25:06.296
Go on. Apologize.

25:13.178 --> 25:14.054
Sorry.

25:18.308 --> 25:19.809
I'm really sorry.

25:22.354 --> 25:23.313
If you're sorry…

25:25.440 --> 25:26.733
let me hit you once.

25:28.235 --> 25:29.069
What?

25:30.195 --> 25:33.198
You're not really sorry,
so let me hit you.

25:34.991 --> 25:35.825
Is that so?

25:36.618 --> 25:38.245
One hit. Take it like a man.

25:41.915 --> 25:46.086
I said I am really, sincerely
so fucking sorry, Beom-seok.

25:52.509 --> 25:53.426
Crazy bastard!

25:57.889 --> 25:58.723
Are you okay?

26:12.487 --> 26:13.989
Hey!

26:16.908 --> 26:17.742
Hey!

26:18.868 --> 26:20.036
That's enough!

26:21.079 --> 26:22.330
Don't cross the line!

26:25.417 --> 26:27.210
Hey!

26:28.044 --> 26:28.962
Don't go too far.

26:29.045 --> 26:30.922
I said let go of me, fucker!

26:31.006 --> 26:33.383
Hey, you fucker!

26:35.635 --> 26:36.970
Let go, you bastard!

26:49.733 --> 26:50.609
You guys.

26:51.985 --> 26:53.820
Don't call Beom-seok again.

27:00.660 --> 27:02.454
You're smothering me.

27:03.121 --> 27:04.789
Okay, man. I'm sorry.

27:05.290 --> 27:06.249
Fuck.

27:06.958 --> 27:08.793
I told you to stop doing that!

27:08.877 --> 27:11.129
Fuck, why do you always drag me around?

27:11.212 --> 27:12.047
What?

27:12.130 --> 27:14.382
Why are you always bossing me around?

27:14.466 --> 27:17.469
Do I have to fucking stop
just because you said so?

27:17.969 --> 27:21.514
Do you know what those fuckers did to me?
You have no idea.

27:22.682 --> 27:24.476
When did I boss you around?

27:24.559 --> 27:26.686
You did fucking boss me around!

27:26.770 --> 27:28.521
Do I have to stop because you said so?

27:28.605 --> 27:30.065
Fuck, am I your lackey?

27:30.148 --> 27:30.982
Hey.

27:33.151 --> 27:34.694
Did I do something wrong?

27:35.820 --> 27:37.781
I took off from work to help you.

27:37.864 --> 27:38.907
So what the fuck?

27:39.783 --> 27:40.909
Hey, that's enough.

27:41.493 --> 27:42.535
You helped me?

27:43.203 --> 27:44.996
What, should I be grateful?

27:45.080 --> 27:46.873
Fuck, should I pay your wages?

27:47.874 --> 27:50.168
Fucking bastard.

27:51.086 --> 27:52.420
Try saying that again.

27:54.631 --> 27:56.257
Watch what you fucking say.

27:58.510 --> 28:00.720
Hey, let go of him and just talk.

28:01.388 --> 28:02.222
Okay?

28:12.065 --> 28:12.899
Fuck.

28:16.361 --> 28:17.404
Hey, Beom-seok!

28:19.364 --> 28:20.240
Crazy bastard.

28:23.201 --> 28:24.452
I'll go after him.

28:37.173 --> 28:38.007
Beom-seok.

28:42.679 --> 28:43.972
What's this all about?

28:48.059 --> 28:48.893
Are you okay?

28:53.648 --> 28:55.024
Yeah, I'm fine.

28:58.027 --> 28:58.987
I'm gonna go.

29:22.594 --> 29:25.138
The number you are calling
cannot be reached…

29:25.221 --> 29:26.598
Motherfucker!

29:42.155 --> 29:43.072
Oh Beom-seok?

29:44.491 --> 29:45.867
What? No glasses today?

29:47.952 --> 29:49.496
Did you come to hang out?

29:49.579 --> 29:50.580
Hey, Beom-seok!

30:04.803 --> 30:05.762
Come with us.

30:06.888 --> 30:07.889
Hey.

30:08.389 --> 30:10.099
What's this? Mungang High?

30:10.934 --> 30:12.227
Little rich boys?

30:15.814 --> 30:16.940
I said come on.

30:17.440 --> 30:18.608
You fucker.

30:20.193 --> 30:22.654
This Mungang cocksucker
wants to mess with Byuksan?

30:23.321 --> 30:24.280
You want to die?

30:25.949 --> 30:27.700
Fuck, I could use some money.

30:27.784 --> 30:29.410
You're rich, right?

30:31.454 --> 30:32.831
Hey, don't be scared.

30:32.914 --> 30:34.582
Let's have a little chat.

30:36.751 --> 30:38.419
Raise your head, fuck.

30:39.045 --> 30:40.171
Properly, asshole.

30:42.757 --> 30:45.009
- Raise it. You too.
- Stay close.

30:45.093 --> 30:47.053
Why did you fuck with Beom-seok?

30:49.138 --> 30:50.223
Fuck.

30:50.306 --> 30:51.432
Take out your phone.

30:53.309 --> 30:54.769
667502.

30:55.895 --> 30:57.313
1184117.

30:58.106 --> 30:59.357
Lee Jeong-chan.

31:01.818 --> 31:02.777
How much is it?

31:03.736 --> 31:05.029
What the hell?

31:05.113 --> 31:07.490
- They don't have much.
- See you later, fucker.

31:11.703 --> 31:13.705
You fucker, what are you glaring at?

31:13.788 --> 31:15.123
Got something to say?

31:15.206 --> 31:17.166
What is it, you piece of shit?

31:17.250 --> 31:20.336
Son of a bitch, fuck you!

31:20.420 --> 31:22.046
He's fucking lost it.

31:26.134 --> 31:28.136
If you're gonna stamp on him, do it right!

31:28.219 --> 31:30.597
Stamp more! That's right!

31:30.680 --> 31:32.140
- Fuck you!
- Do it right!

31:32.223 --> 31:34.767
What did you want to say, fucker?

31:39.397 --> 31:40.231
Shit!

31:41.190 --> 31:43.401
Watch what you fucking say!

31:56.122 --> 31:58.124
Finished? Let's go for a drink.

32:01.210 --> 32:02.045
Yeah.

32:16.309 --> 32:17.644
That girl looked like Su-jin!

32:17.727 --> 32:21.105
- Let's pick up some girls!
- We need a bottle of vodka, then.

32:21.189 --> 32:22.774
- How much do you have?
- Nothing.

32:22.857 --> 32:24.233
What about our loot?

32:24.317 --> 32:26.444
That just covers
what we already have, dumbass.

32:26.527 --> 32:29.405
Forget it! There are six of us,
so it's hard to get girls anyway.

32:31.115 --> 32:33.534
Hey, I'm buying, so get it all.

32:33.618 --> 32:34.869
What's that?

32:34.953 --> 32:36.537
Hey, what's that?

32:36.621 --> 32:37.914
Beom-seok!

32:40.083 --> 32:42.502
- Oh Beom-seok!
- Order something nice.

32:42.585 --> 32:44.295
- Oh Beom-seok!
- Wait a second!

32:44.379 --> 32:46.339
- Get in the shot!
- Hold up the money!

32:46.422 --> 32:47.799
Move in. Hold up the money.

32:47.882 --> 32:49.634
One, two, three!

32:51.094 --> 32:52.178
Cheers!

32:55.640 --> 32:57.183
Hurry up and find some hot girls!

32:57.684 --> 32:58.977
It's 500,000 won!

32:59.560 --> 33:01.521
- How's the drink?
- It's good.

33:05.316 --> 33:07.443
Hey, Beom-seok. What's your Instagram?

33:08.194 --> 33:09.362
I'll tag you.

33:14.826 --> 33:17.078
- Follow me, and I'll follow you back.
- Okay.

33:18.663 --> 33:19.664
Done!

33:22.208 --> 33:24.919
- Hey, right there.
- Where?

33:26.129 --> 33:29.215
- Let's go together.
- Go with him!

33:29.298 --> 33:31.676
- I can't do this.
- Fuck, I'll get the girls.

33:32.260 --> 33:33.553
You must succeed!

33:35.138 --> 33:36.806
Hey, they're on it.

33:36.889 --> 33:39.726
- Let's toast!
- Cheers!

33:42.603 --> 33:44.188
Hey, don't drink it all at once!

33:46.983 --> 33:49.485
- You're going to get wasted.
- It's strong.

33:52.905 --> 33:54.907
- Beom-seok!
- Let's get him a girl tonight.

33:54.991 --> 33:56.951
Let's find Beom-seok's type.

33:59.996 --> 34:01.247
She's not hot enough.

34:01.330 --> 34:02.623
Fuck, he's picky.

34:02.707 --> 34:04.751
- You're the weird one.
- Just a sec.

34:05.626 --> 34:06.711
What about that girl?

34:09.172 --> 34:11.924
AHN SU-HO

34:12.008 --> 34:13.468
Hey, you!

34:13.551 --> 34:14.886
Hey, where?

34:14.969 --> 34:16.679
- Thank you!
- Yeah, thanks.

34:16.763 --> 34:18.222
UNFOLLOW

34:18.306 --> 34:19.640
- Where?
- Look!

34:21.184 --> 34:22.268
They're back.

34:23.936 --> 34:25.146
Salute, you loser!

34:25.229 --> 34:26.314
Go kill yourself!

34:26.397 --> 34:27.440
For real?

34:27.523 --> 34:30.318
No. Up close, she wasn't my type at all.

34:30.401 --> 34:31.694
So that's why you did this shit?

34:31.778 --> 34:34.197
- Because she's fucking ugly!
- Whatever.

34:34.280 --> 34:37.075
You didn't even say a word!

34:37.158 --> 34:38.910
Just sit down or go home!

34:39.452 --> 34:41.996
- Pour me another.
- Give me more.

34:43.206 --> 34:45.041
- Hey, I'm a bit drunk.
- No way.

34:45.124 --> 34:46.959
- You can't be drunk.
- I am.

34:48.920 --> 34:50.338
Where's he going?

34:50.421 --> 34:51.964
Where are you going?

35:13.444 --> 35:14.654
Are you having fun?

35:19.325 --> 35:20.701
Drink with us.

35:28.042 --> 35:29.961
- What's he doing?
- Really?

38:43.654 --> 38:45.406
ALL NAMES, PLACES, AND EVENTS SHOWN
ARE FICTIONAL

38:45.489 --> 38:46.949
ANY SIMILARITY TO REALITY IS COINCIDENTAL

38:47.450 --> 38:50.786
Subtitle translation by: James Webb
